<title>USA: Greenfield German market poor.</title>
<headline>Greenfield German market poor.</headline>
<dateline>AUGUSTA, Ga. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenfield Industries Inc said Thursday that most of its markets appear to be maintaining relatively high demand levels, except for certain markets, particularly Germany.</p>
<p>The German market has continued to experience relatively poor economic conditions coupled with a significant increase in the value of the dollar as compared with the German mark, Greenfield said.</p>
<p>The company said that during the first quarter it continued to make progress in its operations, particularly those relating to its industrial and consumer products group.</p>
<p>The company said most of its markets are favorable as compared with the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
</text>
